Benchmark local invocation latency (P50/P95/P99/max)

Usage: tensor-wasm bench [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Path to the `.wasm` file to benchmark

Options:
      --export <EXPORT>  Name of the export to call on each iteration [default: main]
      --tenant <TENANT>  Tenant id to advertise on outbound API requests via `X-TensorWasm-Tenant`. Zero (the default) suppresses the header for backwards compatibility [default: 0]
      --n <N>            Number of iterations to run. Must be >= 1 [default: 100]
  -h, --help             Print help
